WEBVTT

00:31:29.042 --> 00:31:33.101
to hold unaccountable
law enforcement officials accountable,

00:31:33.125 --> 00:31:35.309
we will bring pattern
and practice lawsuits,

00:31:35.333 --> 00:31:37.684
because the justice department
is not doing that,

00:31:37.708 --> 00:31:39.809
so we will continue to do
all that good work.

00:31:39.833 --> 00:31:43.143
But the real thing is,
we're going to go after those budgets.

00:31:43.167 --> 00:31:44.434
When you look at the fact

00:31:44.458 --> 00:31:46.601
that we spend 100 million
dollars on policing,

00:31:46.625 --> 00:31:48.643
more than incarceration,

00:31:48.667 --> 00:31:53.601
that the city of Minneapolis
spent 30 percent of their budget

00:31:53.625 --> 00:31:55.184
on policing.

00:31:55.208 --> 00:31:58.792
The city of Oakland,
41 percent on policing.

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:02.434
That when you have New York City
police department